@*
=========================================================
FILE: CountrySelect.razor

PURPOSE:
A country select box.

RESPONSIBILITIES:
- Render a country select box

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Markup only. Text comes from OperationsText (L-10); values come from the endpoint
- Tenant surface: never says "Vixly" (ADR-0012 W-1); owner only (the use cases refuse others)
- Static forms with antiforgery and the form guard (ADR-0019); placeholder look: Frontend/UI designs the final experience
=========================================================
*@
@inject IStringLocalizer<OperationsText> T

<label class="@Class">@T["ui.editor.country"]
    <select name="@Name" required>
        <option value="">@T["ui.editor.choose"]</option>
        @foreach ((string country, string name) in OperationsCountries.Options(T))
        {
            <option value="@country" selected="@(country == Value)">@OperationsCountries.Flag(country) @name</option>
        }
    </select>
</label>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Parameter] public string? Value { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public string? Class { get; set; }
}
